Fonts

assets/fonts/DejaVuSans-Bold.ttf is not covered by the licence above. It
is part of the DejaVu Fonts and is distributed under the DejaVu Fonts
Licence, a free licence derived from the Bitstream Vera Fonts Licence:
https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/License.html

The other font families this program can use are not part of this
repository. install.bat fetches them from the Google Fonts repository
(https://github.com/google/fonts), where every family carries its own
licence - most of them the SIL Open Font License 1.1, some the Apache
License 2.0. Those licences travel with the files themselves.
